{
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Bash(git *)",
      "Bash(gh api *)",
      "Bash(npm run *)",
      "Bash(npm ci *)",
      "Bash(npx tsc *)",
      "Bash(npx next *)",
      "Bash(npx eslint *)",
      "Bash(node scripts/*)",
      "Bash(psql *)",
      "mcp__github__*"
    ],
    "deny": [
      "Bash(git push --force origin master*)",
      "Bash(git push -f origin master*)",
      "Bash(git push --force-with-lease origin master*)",
      "Bash(git push origin --delete master*)",
      "Bash(git push origin :master*)",
      "Bash(gh api -X DELETE repos/cpetit2025/jrm-tms/git/refs/heads/master*)"
    ]
  },
  "enabledPlugins": {
    "ponytail@ponytail": true,
    "agent-skills@addy-agent-skills": true
  },
  "extraKnownMarketplaces": {
    "ponytail": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "DietrichGebert/ponytail"
      }
    },
    "addy-agent-skills": {
      "source": {
        "source": "git",
        "url": "https://github.com/addyosmani/agent-skills.git"
      }
    }
  },
  "autoMode": {
    "allow": [
      "$defaults",
      "En el repositorio cpetit2025/jrm-tms el dueño autorizó: mergear PR validados a master, desplegar con el workflow deploy-production.yml y lanzarlo manualmente (workflow_dispatch), incluidas las inspecciones de solo lectura (audit_only, audit_scope all/apt/apt-performance); leer sus anotaciones, logs y artefactos; y ejecutar en producción consultas de diagnóstico de solo lectura que terminan en ROLLBACK.",
      "Push a ramas claude/* y commits de scripts de auditoría o diagnóstico de solo lectura en scripts/security/."
    ]
  },
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash|Grep",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "graphify hook-guard search",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Read|Glob",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "graphify hook-guard read",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
